            "text": "waistcoat stitch"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " throw is 90 x 100 cm. The hook enters both vertical legs of the V-shape of each stitch below rather than the normal top loops. Completed as a dc, the stitch produces a surface that resembles stocking stitch knitting."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A slightly larger hook than usual for aran is needed because the insertion into the V tightens the stitch. The fabric is denser and warmer than regular dc. Total yardage is around 720 g."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "suppliesCard",
        "attrs": {
          "heading": "Materials",
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "Aran yarn",
              "qty": "720 g"
            },
            {
              "name": "6 mm crochet hook",
              "qty": "1"
            },
            {
              "name": "Tapestry needle",
              "qty": "1"
            },
            {
              "name": "Scissors",
              "qty": "1 pair"
